    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Gunblaze Epoch&quot;</strong> is a top-down roguelike shooter that incorporates elements of weak search, combat, and retreat. The game features diverse maps, weapons, and items, along with extensive meta-progression for upgrades and management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Varied World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 core story maps + 4 optional zones, totaling 10 unique stages for varied challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse rooms &amp; fully destructible maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Weapon And Item Synergies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers over 100 unique weapons and 100+ distinct items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Item Synergy System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-Lite Headquarters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive base-building system for persistent upgrades and enhanced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters also possess unique skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast Underground World to Explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore underground to collect coins and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique black market for currency exchange.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search, Combat, Retreat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Withdraw when weakened, but usually requires defeating the floor boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death leaves behind a safety deposit box with partial resources on the current map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry external items into each run.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Gunblaze Epoch&quot;</strong> is a top-down roguelike shooter that incorporates elements of weak search, combat, and retreat. The game features diverse maps, weapons, and items, along with extensive meta-progression for upgrades and management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Varied World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 core story maps + 4 optional zones, totaling 10 unique stages for varied challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse rooms &amp; fully destructible maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/4722c61a73bb5d6e94836d35e7118724.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Weapon And Item Synergies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers over 100 unique weapons and 100+ distinct items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Item Synergy System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/b813a2922f6d7746bfd72b26e142d6bc.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-Lite Headquarters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive base-building system for persistent upgrades and enhanced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters also possess unique skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/08f79fa847d64c8b89c32359a64932ab.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast Underground World to Explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore underground to collect coins and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique black market for currency exchange.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.poster.avif?t=1754474057\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.webm?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/42766348d1427f7301ec169a13574ca0.mp4?t=1754474057\" type=\"video/mp4\"><